<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 26-MAY					     .</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 26-MAY					     .</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Depression 05W is causing locally heavy rain over Luzon, Philippines. This is not a very strong weather system at this time, with top winds only near 25 mph. The main threat will be from heavy showers which may cause local flash flooding.  </p>
<p>THERE ARE NO FURTHER EMERGENCY WEATHER STATEMENTS  </p>
